00:00:00,298 --> 00:00:03,539
part 1 chapter 4.

2
00:00:03,539 --> 00:00:07,500
With the deep, unconscious sigh which not even the nearness of the telescreen

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:11,698
could prevent him from uttering when his day's work started, Winston pulled the

4
00:00:11,698 --> 00:00:17,338
speak right towards him, blew the dust from its mouthpiece and put on his spectacles.

5
00:00:17,338 --> 00:00:21,179
Then he unrolled and clipped together four small cylinders of paper which had

6
