11
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:46,859
This last was for the disposal of waste paper.

12
00:00:46,859 --> 00:00:50,579
Similar slits existed in thousands or tens of thousands throughout the

13
00:00:50,579 --> 00:00:54,838
